    "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a9/Asuka_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest?cb=20240820140555\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Asuka Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break \" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/queensblade/images/a/a9/Asuka_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/400?cb=20240820140555\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"400\" height=\"880\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Asuka Queen&#39;s Blade Unlimited Limit Break .jpg\" data-image-key=\"Asuka_Queen%27s_Blade_Unlimited_Limit_Break_.jpg\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span>\n</p><p><b>半藏的继承人</b>\n</p><p>飞鸟(飛鳥)是《闪乱神乐》系列的主角。她是国立学院忍者的领导者。\n\n</p><p>半藏国立学院的一名二年级学生。她的祖父半藏被誉为传说中的忍者，也是学院名字的由来。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Appearance\">外观</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAsuka%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>飞鸟是个个子不高的女孩，深棕色的头发用白色发带扎成马尾。与《闪乱神乐》系列中的许多其他女性角色一样，她身材丰满，极其性感，拥有惊人硕大而富有弹性的胸部、柔软厚实的大腿，以及相当丰满圆润的臀部。 \n \n</p><p>在忍者装束下，她穿着黄色背心搭配白色衬衫，以及一条与领带相配的绿色格纹裙。腿上穿着黑色过膝袜和棕色乐福鞋，双臂佩戴护具，护具下缠着绷带。腰间有束带用于固定佩剑，在这种形态下她依然戴着那条红色短围巾。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Personality\">性格</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAsuka%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D2&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<p>「我们在很多方面如此相似，却又如此不同。每次见面都会大打出手。也许这就是命运吧。」——飞鸟，《闪乱神乐：少女们的证明》\n\n</p><p>飞鸟是个开朗友善的女孩，坚信团队合作、团结一心和友谊。她看起来常常容易上当受骗、笨手笨脚，但她用决心和真诚弥补了这些。\n\n</p><p>由于外祖父的教导，飞鸟有着某种和平主义的天性，除非她认为完全必要，否则她不认同打斗或伤害他人。正因为如此，敌对势力的其他忍者常常认为她天真，因为忍者职业的本质终究是夺人性命。\n\n</p>\n<h3><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gallery\">画廊</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fqueensblade.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAsuka%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D3&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h3>\n<div id=\"gallery-0\" hash=\"f6bfd105b5c889820f97e00c72f3aad6\" data-seq-no=\"0\" class=\"wikia-gallery wikia-gallery-caption-below wikia-gallery-position-left wikia-gallery-spacing-medium wikia-gallery-border-small wikia-gallery-captions-left wikia-gallery-caption-size-medium\"><div class=\"wikia-gallery-caption\"></div><div class=\"wikia-gallery-item\" style=\"width:187px; \">